    #          two cols, sheetViews or mergeCells elements, or a sheetViews
    #          without a sheetView"; S3C one.
    # (P) --pagesetup-sample, M3 part 3 P2's cases:
    #       P0 the bare template, exit 0, its line;
    #       P1 two <pageSetup/>: the part's message; P1C one;
    #       P2 a <pageSetup/> and then a <pageMargins/>: the same; P2C in order;
    #       P3 two <headerFooter/>: the same; P3C one.
    # (Q) --printarea-sample, M3 part 3 P3's cases:
    #       Q0 the bare template, exit 0, its line;
    #       T1 a table part on W whose ref is A1:H2, over the area: specs/0021's
    #          overlap message, "a table overlaps a table, a pivot table, a merge
    #          or the autofilter"; T1C the table at A3:H9, clear of it;
    #       A2 two <autoFilter>: the part's message; A2C one;
    #       F3 a row 1048576 with a cell, so M + 1 is past the grid: part 3's
    #          index message; F3C a row 2 with a cell.
    # Each refusal: exit 2, the error line exactly the message the committed
    # source holds, no stdout, no output file. Then the part's messages, read from
