    #      relationships prefix, a worksheet relationships part and a table part
    #      (Q). The expected lines are the three earlier logs' (S_NONE, S_PR,
    #      S_VIEWS; P_NONE, P_SETUP, P_BOTH, P_HF; Q_PLAIN, Q_BOUND, Q_FILTER).
    #      The part's write message is reached six ways; the overlap, the index
    #      and part 3's two-elements messages, shared with earlier parts, apart.
    #  KC. The part's messages and the seven bodies are P3's; no source change
