    #      lines, the probes the size-probe crate). TWO_ELEMENTS joins
    #      TABLE_OVERLAP and INDEX_OUT_OF_RANGE among the messages read apart.
    #      "a sheet setting is out of range", "a header or footer text is not
    #      valid" and "a print area or title is not valid" are stated unreachable
    #      through the tool (each sample's settings, texts and title pair are its
    #      constants), each with the crate tests that cover it and each test's
    #      body asserted to hold the message. The overlap message is looked for in
    #      the working spec, which now equals the committed one: "Planning rulings
    #      during P3" ruling 1 quotes it there.
